{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "orren_intro_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "gloomridge",
      "tone": "stoic",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "He's sitting on a stone that turns out to be a grave marker.",
        "He doesn't move when you approach. Just looks up. \"You're heading toward the Veil.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "confirm",
          "text": "\"We are.\"",
          "next": "#orren_joins",
          "effects": [{ "type": "set_flag", "flag": "companion_orren_met" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "question",
          "text": "\"What's it to you?\"",
          "next": "#orren_reason",
          "effects": [{ "type": "set_flag", "flag": "companion_orren_met" }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_joins": {
          "lines": ["\"Then I'll come. I have unfinished business in that direction.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Come on, then.\"", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        },
        "orren_reason": {
          "lines": ["\"My brother is buried in the Veilscar. His name is on no roster. I want to at least know where he died.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "accept", "text": "\"Come with us.\"", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_pauldrons_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "stoneward",
      "tone": "quiet",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "The cracked pauldron on his left shoulder has been cracked the same way for as long as you've known him.",
        "\"My brother cracked it.\" He says it before you ask. \"We were sparring. I wouldn't let him fix it.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_why",
          "text": "\"Why not?\"",
          "next": "#orren_why",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "leave_it",
          "text": "Don't ask.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 1 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_why": {
          "lines": ["\"Because then it would be mine and not his anymore.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "Nod. Don't push.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_dead_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "gloomridge",
      "tone": "matter-of-fact",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "He buries the enemy dead after every fight. Doesn't say anything about it.",
        "You ask."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "text": "\"Even cultists?\"",
          "next": "#orren_even",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "help",
          "text": "Help without asking.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 3 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_even": {
          "lines": ["\"Even cultists. They were something before they were that.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "help", "text": "Help him.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }] }, { "id": "go", "text": "Leave him to it.", "next": null, "effects": [] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_quest_start_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "veilscar",
      "tone": "focused",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "He stops at a crossroads marker.",
        "\"This is the boundary of where his patrol was last reported.\" He traces the marker with one finger. \"He's somewhere in here.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "help_search",
          "text": "Help him search.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 3 }, { "type": "quest_advance", "questId": "companion_quest_orren", "step": "search_begun" }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "orren_quest_started" }]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_what_happened",
          "text": "Ask what happened to the patrol.",
          "next": "#orren_patrol",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_patrol": {
          "lines": ["\"Six soldiers. Standard Emberguard patrol. They entered the Veilscar after a surge report.\" A pause. \"No one received their signal after the second day.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "help", "text": "Help him find out what happened.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 3 }, { "type": "set_flag", "flag": "orren_quest_started" }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_betrayal_reveal_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "veilscar",
      "tone": "devastating",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "requires": { "flag": "orren_quest_started" },
      "lines": [
        "The records are in the library ruin.",
        "The patrol didn't disappear. It was ordered into the Veilscar without extraction plans. No exit. Just a reporting assignment someone needed completed — and a way to lose the bodies afterward."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "stay_with_orren",
          "text": "Stay with him while he reads it.",
          "next": "#orren_reads",
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "give_space",
          "text": "Give him space.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 1 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_reads": {
          "lines": ["He doesn't cry. His hands are very still on the document.", "\"I thought he was lost. That's easier than this.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"What do you want to do?\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "set_flag", "flag": "bram_betrayal_revealed" }, { "type": "quest_advance", "questId": "companion_quest_orren", "step": "truth_found" }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_night_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "ash_plains",
      "tone": "reflective",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "\"In the Emberguard we had a saying: the dead are owed a clean report.\"",
        "\"Someone didn't write one for Adric. I intend to correct that.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_report",
          "text": "\"What goes in a clean report?\"",
          "next": "#clean_report",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "support",
          "text": "\"We'll help you write it.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "clean_report": {
          "lines": ["\"How they died. Who gave the order. Whether it was worth it.\" He looks at the plains. \"It wasn't.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Then the report will say that.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_approval_high_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 2,
      "biome": "crossroads",
      "tone": "dry",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "\"You make fewer mistakes than I expected.\"",
        "\"That's not a compliment — it's an observation. My expectations started low.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "accept",
          "text": "\"I'll take it.\"",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_rift_moment_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 3,
      "biome": "riftgate",
      "tone": "grim-ready",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "\"This is where Adric's patrol last reported from.\"",
        "He doesn't say anything else. He just checks his sword."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "stand_beside",
          "text": "Stand beside him.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }]
        },
        {
          "id": "lead",
          "text": "Lead the way in.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 1 }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_quest_closure_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 3,
      "biome": "sovereigns_approach",
      "tone": "resolved",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "requires": { "flag": "bram_betrayal_revealed" },
      "lines": [
        "\"I filed the report. Three hours ago. Through the Thornpact courier.\"",
        "\"Someone in the Brightfall Council will be uncomfortable before the week is out.\""
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_how_feel",
          "text": "\"How does it feel?\"",
          "next": "#orren_feels",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "nod",
          "text": "Nod. He doesn't need more than that.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }, { "type": "quest_advance", "questId": "companion_quest_orren", "step": "complete" }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_feels": {
          "lines": ["\"Like someone opened a door in a house I've been locked in for three years.\" A pause. \"Cold. But better than the inside.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "go", "text": "\"Come on. One more door to open.\"", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 1 }, { "type": "quest_advance", "questId": "companion_quest_orren", "step": "complete" }] }]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orren_graveyard_habit_001",
      "pool": "companion-orren_gravetide",
      "companionId": "orren_gravetide",
      "act": 1,
      "biome": "old_road",
      "tone": "ritual",
      "speaker": "orren_gravetide",
      "lines": [
        "Every graveyard you pass, he stops for exactly one minute.",
        "He doesn't explain unless asked."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "text": "Ask why.",
          "next": "#orren_why_stops",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "wait",
          "text": "Wait with him without asking.",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }]
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "orren_why_stops": {
          "lines": ["\"It's a habit from the Emberguard. We were taught that every dead deserves a witness.\"", "\"One minute per grave-ground. That's the minimum.\""],
          "choices": [{ "id": "join", "text": "Join the habit.", "next": null, "effects": [{ "type": "companion_approval", "companionId": "orren_gravetide", "amount": 2 }] }]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
